.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:2:date: 2026-05-24
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:3:session: 1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:4:status: accepted
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:5:feature: session-foundations-bundle-b
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:6:loop: planning
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:7:finding-id: symlink-restore-depth-wrong
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:8:type: design_flaw
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:9:domain: process
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:10:disposition: addressed
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:11:confidence: 98
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:12:severity: High
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:13:surfaced-by: claude+codex (convergent)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:14:addressed-in: iter2 Fix 1
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:15:supersedes: null
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:16:mistake-candidate: true
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:17:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:19:# Symlink restore recipe used wrong `../` prefix depth (addressed in iter2)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:21:## What went wrong
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:23:Planning iter1 § Execution intake notes prescribed `ln -sfn ../../.gobbi/...` (2-dot prefix) for restoring broken workspace symlinks. Actual `.claude/skills/<topic>/SKILL.md` symlinks use `../../../` (3-dot prefix). An executor following the iter1 recipe would have created symlinks pointing to the wrong target, breaking the workspace.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:25:## Why it went wrong
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:26:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:27:The recipe was derived by memory/paraphrase from the Preparation edit-contract decision rather than empirically verified. The author assumed 2 levels of indirection (`.claude/skills/<topic>/`) = 2-dot prefix; but relative symlink paths count the hops from the symlink's own location to the target, requiring 3 dots for this specific directory depth.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:28:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:29:## How to recognize
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:30:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:31:- Any symlink restore recipe that prescribes a fixed `../` count without citing an empirical `ls -la` verification is suspect.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:32:- The correct workflow: run `ls -la .claude/skills/<any-existing-skill>/SKILL.md` first; observe the actual `->` target; match the prefix count.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:33:- For `SKILL.md` directly under `.claude/skills/<topic>/`: 3 dots (`../../../`)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:34:- For files under `.claude/skills/<topic>/<sub>/`: 4 dots (`../../../../`)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:35:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:36:## Corrected approach
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:37:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:38:Symlink restore recipe (empirically verified 2026-05-24):
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:39:```
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:40:rm -f .claude/skills/<path> && ln -sfn ../../../.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/<path> .claude/skills/<path>
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:41:```
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:42:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:43:Depth disclaimer: "The exact `../../../` prefix depends on the file's depth — verify against an adjacent untouched symlink with `ls -la`."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:44:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:45:Every planning brief that includes symlink restore instructions MUST embed the empirical witness (`ls -la` result) alongside the recipe.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:46:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:47:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:48:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:49:- draft-iter2.md:520 (§ Execution intake notes Edit-tool default block)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:50:- draft-iter2.md:447 (§ Agent assignment table edit-contract brief note)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/symlink-restore-depth-wrong.md:51:- Preparation iter3 staging decisions `mirror-propagation-policy-mirror-canonical-symlinks.md`
