.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/edit-tool-refuses-symlink-paths.md:4:status: accepted
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/edit-tool-refuses-symlink-paths.md:5:feature: session-foundations-bundle-b
