   127	
   128	```
   129	jq -r '.git.branch' .gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/<latest>/session.json
   130	```
   131	
   132	Expected match: `^chore/session-[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}-[a-f0-9]{8}$`
