    86	| `orchestration/SKILL.md` Step 1 rows 5/5.5/6 | Row 5: P2 invocation, idempotency 3-state machine, direct-mode guard, branch naming; produces in-turn worktree path. Row 5: footnote — direct-mode opt-out prose (LOCK #5). Row 5.5: state.json init using the in-turn worktree path. Row 6: `git.branch` + `git.worktreePath` stamp source. Smoke-test gate prose. |
    87	| `orchestration/SKILL.md` Step 1 — smoke-test gate | Post-merge verification: `jq -r '.git.branch'` matches `^chore/session-[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}-[a-f0-9]{8}$`; `jq -r '.git.worktreePath'` returns non-null for `worktree-pr` sessions. |
